-- coa30-sch13.l4: Schedule 13 (Supplementary provisions with respect to delegation order), lines 20689-20779 of
-- ukpga-2006-46.txt (coa30's ranges). Generated by work/gen_sch13.py; quote lines copied by work/build.py.
-- HOW TO READ AN ANSWER: as in coa30-sch10-part1.l4. A "delegation order" is an order under section 1252 (coa27) that
-- designates a body to exercise the Secretary of State's functions under Part 42; the body is "established by the order"
-- or "an existing body" (para 1). The provisions about who sits on the body and how it meets (paras 3 and 5), the powers to
-- make orders (paras 7(3), 11(2) to (4), 12) are machinery and are inert (reason 2); the rest are encoded.

§ `Schedule 13 -- Supplementary provisions with respect to delegation order`

-- ---- paragraph 1: Operation of this Schedule ----

-- src:20692 | 1 (1) This Schedule has effect in relation to a body designated by a delegation order under section 1252 as follows—
-- src:20693 | (a) paragraphs 2 to 12 have effect in relation to the body where it is established by the order;
-- src:20694 | (b) paragraphs 2 and 6 to 11 have effect in relation to the body where it is an existing body;
-- src:20695 | (c) paragraph 13 has effect in relation to the body where it is an existing body that is an unincorporated association.
@ref sch 13 para 1(1) How the Schedule has effect in relation to a body designated by a delegation order (src:20692-20695)
GIVEN `the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` IS A NUMBER
      `the body is established by the order` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the body is an existing body` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the existing body is an unincorporated association` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 13 para 1(1) the paragraph has effect in relation to the body` MEANS
    IF    (`the body is established by the order` AND `the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` AT LEAST 2 AND `the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` AT MOST 12)
       OR (`the body is an existing body` AND (`the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` EQUALS 2 OR (`the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` AT LEAST 6 AND `the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` AT MOST 11)))
       OR (`the body is an existing body` AND `the existing body is an unincorporated association` AND `the number of the paragraph of this Schedule` EQUALS 13)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This Schedule has effect in relation to a body designated by a delegation order as follows"

-- src:20696 | (2) In their operation in accordance with sub-paragraph (1)(b), paragraphs 2 and 6 apply only in relation to—
-- src:20697 | (a) things done by or in relation to the body in or in connection with the exercise of functions transferred to it by the delegation order, and
-- src:20698 | (b) functions of the body which are functions so transferred.
@ref sch 13 para 1(2) For an existing body, paragraphs 2 and 6 apply only to transferred functions (src:20696-20698)
GIVEN `the thing is done by or in relation to the body in or in connection with the exercise of functions transferred to it by the delegation order` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the function is a function of the body which is a function so transferred` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 13 para 1(2) paragraph 2 or 6 applies to the existing body in relation to the thing or function` MEANS
    IF `the thing is done by or in relation to the body in or in connection with the exercise of functions transferred to it by the delegation order` OR `the function is a function of the body which is a function so transferred`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "paragraphs 2 and 6 apply only in relation to"

-- src:20699 | (3) Any power conferred by this Schedule to make provision by order is a power to make provision by an order under section 1252.
@ref sch 13 para 1(3) Any power to make provision by order is a power under section 1252 (src:20699-20699)
GIVEN `the power to make provision by order is conferred by this Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 13 para 1(3) the power is a power to make provision by an order under section 1252` MEANS
    IF `the power to make provision by order is conferred by this Schedule`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any power conferred by this Schedule to make provision by order"

